---
// 旧主题的无语言前缀路径统一规范化到 /en/*
// 使用静态 HTML meta refresh 重定向
---
<html>
<head>
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/en/services">
  <link rel="canonical" href="/en/services">
  <title>Redirecting to Services Page</title>
</head>
<body>
  <p>Redirecting to <a href="/en/services">Services page</a>...</p>
</body>
</html>